<i>Where is he?</i>

534
00:42:16,992 --> 00:42:18,619
- Fuck.
- For fuck's sake. Fine!

535
00:42:18,702 --> 00:42:19,954
Fuck. I'll make it happen.

536
00:42:20,037 --> 00:42:21,914
I'll fucking arrange something.

537
00:42:23,123 --> 00:42:23,999
That bastard…

538
00:42:25,209 --> 00:42:27,461
Fuck, if you want to meet that bastard…

539
00:42:27,545 --> 00:42:28,963
Die, you fucker.

540
00:42:29,046 --> 00:42:30,339
You fucking…

541
00:42:34,843 --> 00:42:36,220
What did you just say?

542
00:42:37,555 --> 00:42:38,847
Huh?

543
00:43:15,342 --> 00:43:16,218
Hey.

544
00:43:16,719 --> 00:43:18,637
Are you two shooting a music video?

545
00:43:19,388 --> 00:43:21,140
Something might happen tonight.

546
00:43:22,808 --> 00:43:24,560
Stop drinking. You're already drunk.

547
00:43:39,658 --> 00:43:42,328
Let's go. I found that rat bastard.

548
00:43:51,253 --> 00:43:52,212
Stop.

549
00:43:52,296 --> 00:43:53,714
Back up.

550
00:44:09,021 --> 00:44:10,272
What the fuck is this?

551
00:44:41,470 --> 00:44:44,890
DATE OF INTERMENT: FEB 10, 2023
NAME: SEO YU-MIN

552
00:44:49,144 --> 00:44:52,064
He said he wanted to sell his identity
because he had no money.

553
00:44:52,147 --> 00:44:54,316
So I bought it. Fuck.

554
00:44:54,400 --> 00:44:57,111
But they said
he killed himself a week later.

555
00:44:57,611 --> 00:44:59,071
Happy now? Fucking hell.

556
00:45:00,781 --> 00:45:02,741
How was I supposed to know

557
00:45:02,825 --> 00:45:06,787
the bastard who sold his identity for cash
would end up killing himself?

558
00:45:07,538 --> 00:45:12,000
He fucking died
before I even got his identity.

559
00:45:12,084 --> 00:45:14,294
So we took a loss on that too.

560
00:45:16,880 --> 00:45:18,090
He killed himself?

561
00:45:18,173 --> 00:45:19,383
Yeah.

562
00:45:22,928 --> 00:45:25,097
But how do we know
this is the same bastard?

563
00:45:27,182 --> 00:45:29,852
He was born in August 1994.

564
00:45:29,935 --> 00:45:30,811
Yeah, it's him.

565
00:45:32,855 --> 00:45:33,897
Really?

566
00:45:36,316 --> 00:45:37,943
If he died two years ago…

567
00:45:40,154 --> 00:45:42,156
we've been fucking
barking up the wrong tree.

568
00:46:05,721 --> 00:46:07,222
It was murder.

569
00:46:20,277 --> 00:46:21,612
Who the hell…

570
00:46:23,655 --> 00:46:25,115
is this bastard?

571
00:46:36,668 --> 00:46:38,670
The dead bastard's not talking,

572
00:46:38,754 --> 00:46:41,673
and neither is this living one.

573
00:47:03,821 --> 00:47:05,113
What's that? An ad?

574
00:47:16,041 --> 00:47:18,293
"THE RAT"
AUTHOR EVENT & BOOK SIGNING

575
00:47:48,240 --> 00:47:49,533
It's from yesterday.

576
00:47:51,827 --> 00:47:53,871
<i>Welcome to the publication event</i>
<i>for </i>The Rat<i>,</i>

577
00:47:53,954 --> 00:47:56,290
<i>the new novel by Je Moon-jae,</i>
<i>the faceless…</i>

578
00:47:56,373 --> 00:47:58,250
Wow, this is perfect.

579
00:47:58,333 --> 00:48:01,086
This bastard really is Je Moon-jae now.

580
00:48:01,712 --> 00:48:04,006
This bastard's completely
taken your place.

581
00:48:06,800 --> 00:48:07,634
Hey.

582
00:48:09,761 --> 00:48:10,596
Where are you?

583
00:48:10,679 --> 00:48:12,055
What the hell did you do?

584
00:48:12,139 --> 00:48:13,891
Hey, did you find him?

585
00:48:13,974 --> 00:48:15,392
Why? Was he the wrong guy?

586
00:48:16,977 --> 00:48:19,021
So why snoop around in the wrong place?

587
00:48:19,104 --> 00:48:20,856
I told you to find yourself.

588
00:48:20,939 --> 00:48:23,150
Where are you? Let's talk in person.

589
00:48:23,233 --> 00:48:24,693
<i>Okay? I'll come to you.</i>

590
00:48:25,861 --> 00:48:27,863
Not today. I've got somewhere else to be.

591
00:48:27,946 --> 00:48:30,032
Just tell me where.

592
00:48:30,115 --> 00:48:32,034
I'll come over there.

593
00:48:33,035 --> 00:48:34,369
You wanna come there?

594
00:48:34,453 --> 00:48:35,537
I'll come over there--

595
00:48:36,038 --> 00:48:37,915
Hold on. Is it okay for you to come?

596
00:48:37,998 --> 00:48:39,958
<i>It's fine with me,</i>

597
00:48:40,042 --> 00:48:42,377
but I don't think you should come.

598
00:48:42,461 --> 00:48:45,547
I'll be there.
Just tell me where it is. I'll…

599
00:48:45,631 --> 00:48:46,965
Where is it?! You bastard!

600
00:48:47,049 --> 00:48:50,344
No, it's not like that.
I'm going to file a report.

601
00:48:52,137 --> 00:48:53,764
DONGBU POLICE STATION

602
00:48:53,847 --> 00:48:57,476
<i>On a guy who got surgery</i>
<i>to look like me and is impersonating me.</i>

603
00:48:58,602 --> 00:49:01,355
<i>I've already set up</i>
<i>an alibi, witnesses, and everything.</i>

604
00:49:01,438 --> 00:49:02,773
<i>But what are you gonna do?</i>

605
00:49:06,443 --> 00:49:08,528
No way around
those three years in hiding, huh?

606
00:49:09,780 --> 00:49:11,615
You fucking bastard!

607
00:53:45,931 --> 00:53:48,850
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
